{"id": "1806950", "name": "אינטגרציה בחלקים – (Ax+B)·e^(rx+s)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,dx = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em\">אפשר להשתמש ב־<strong>x</strong> או <strong>X</strong>. הקבוע השרירותי יכול להיות <strong>c</strong>, <strong>C</strong>, <strong>k</strong> או <strong>K</strong>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> אינטגרציה בחלקים: גוזרים את הגורם הלינארי ומבצעים אינטגרציה לפונקציה המעריכית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — בחירת הגורמים</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u={{CT:1}},\\quad u'={{CT:2}},\\qquad v'=e^{{{CT:3}}},\\quad v={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — נוסחת האינטגרציה בחלקים</b><br><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">אינטגרציה בחלקים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\int u\\,v'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'\\,v\\,dx \\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}}\\,dx=uv-\\int u'v\\,dx=\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)\\cdot \\left({{CT:4}}\\right)-\\int \\left({{CT:5}}\\right)dx \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — האינטגרל שנשאר</b><br>האינטגרל של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{kx+c}\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{k}e^{kx+c}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int \\left({{CT:5}}\\right)dx={{CT:6}}+C \\]</p>ומכאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}}\\,dx={{CT:7}}-\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)+C={{CT:8}}+C \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 42, "insertstars": 5, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-CALCULUS]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "למשל: F(x)+C", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "vars0:listofvars(ans1);\nbadvars:delete(K,delete(k,delete(C,delete(c,delete(X,delete(x,vars0))))));\nan1:ev(ans1,X=x,C=c,k=c,K=c);\nstu:ev(diff(an1,x));\nstucheck:if length(badvars)=0 then stu else p+12345;\ndc:ev(diff(an1,c));\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stucheck", "tans": "p", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 